src/testdata/attestation.bin and src/testdata/vcek.der are copied unchanged
from verify/testdata/attestation.bin and verify/testdata/vcek.testcer in that
revision. The report is an actual Milan version-2 VCEK-signed report. Its
certificate and signed data are public test material, not a trust policy.

src/trust/*.pem are AMD-published public certificate chains, copied unchanged
from verify/trust in the same revision. Original source:
https://kdsintf.amd.com/{vcek,vlek}/v1/{Milan,Genoa,Turin}/cert_chain
These embed public certificates only, never private keys.

src/abi.zig describes the Linux userspace interface from
include/uapi/linux/sev-guest.h: Copyright (C) 2021 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
The original UAPI is GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note; its syscall exception
permits use in non-GPL userspace programs. No Linux driver implementation is copied.
